\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. JESUS we thus obey
\par Thy last and kindest word;
\par Here, in Thine own appointed way,
\par We come to meet Thee, Lord.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Our hearts we open wide,
\par To make the Saviour room;
\par And lo! the Lamb, the Crucified,
\par The sinner's Friend, is come.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thy presence makes the feast;
\par Now let our spirits feel
\par The glory not to be expressed,
\par The joy unspeakable.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. With high and heavenly bliss
\par Thou dost our spirits cheer;
\par Thy house of banqueting is this,
\par And Thou hast brought us here.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Now let our souls be fed
\par With manna from above,
\par And over us Thy banner spread
\par Of everlasting love.
\par                Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

